<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-cloudina-hartmannae-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Cloudina hartmannae wall-normal Turing lamella at 2.397 µm (Pass 2) — Code-to-model traceability: 86/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Dispersion, sweep, controls, segmentation, and rendering are separate functions, and the Lean module proves the band membership, the eight-lamella stack, the 43–44× funnel contrast, diffusion-rescaling of the discriminant, and the integer wavenumber balance. lean is not installed in this environment, so the proofs were not executed." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/code-traceability" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-cloudina-hartmannae-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-cloudina-hartmannae-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-2> ;
    pk:hasScore 8.6e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-cloudina-hartmannae-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Cloudina hartmannae wall-normal Turing lamella at 2.397 µm (Pass 2) — Model fidelity to source: 90/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "k_c is solved from the Jacobian so the critical wavelength is 2.397 µm, and the same stepper supplies the nonlinear field, the ablation, and the growth-rate probe. Complex long-wave eigenvalues are plotted and excluded from r, which matches the oscillation those modes actually have. The near-onset discriminant (0.010) is why the fastest real mode is n=8 rather than a longer wave." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-cloudina-hartmannae-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-cloudina-hartmannae-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-cloudina-hartmannae-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 9e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-cloudina-hartmannae-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Cloudina hartmannae wall-normal Turing lamella at 2.397 µm (Pass 2) — Morphometric validation: 88/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Real-eigenvalue σ(k) agrees with the stepper at r=0.99997, RMSE=0.0312. Equal-diffusion σmax=-0.124. Ablation std is ~1e-14 against a patterned std of 0.164. Species-card foreground 0.364, coherency 0.832, circularity 0.057 versus Corumbá fossil 0.635, 0.342, 0.449; none of those pairs are copies. KS against the band-wide normal rejects (0.623, p=0.0016), which is reported as a spike at one wavelength rather than a fit to the whole 0.5–5 µm range. Spacing std is 0 on the commensurate domain, so the score stays below 90." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-cloudina-hartmannae-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-autocatalysis-ablation-activator-std-vs-full-pattern-std>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-cloudina-hartmannae-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-cloudina-wall-lamella-stripe-count-versus-funnel-rung-count-on-the-same-layer>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-cloudina-hartmannae-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-cv-similarity-of-growth-gif-last-frame-vs-species-card>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-cloudina-hartmannae-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-diffusivity-scale-sweep-pearson-r>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-cloudina-hartmannae-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-equal-diffusion-negative-control-max-growth-rate>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-cloudina-hartmannae-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-ks-distance-of-lamella-spacings-vs-yang-band-normal>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-cloudina-hartmannae-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-specimen-image-contour-circularity>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-cloudina-hartmannae-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-specimen-image-foreground-fraction>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-cloudina-hartmannae-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-specimen-image-lamella-stripe-wavelength>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-cloudina-hartmannae-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-specimen-image-structure-tensor-coherency>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-cloudina-hartmannae-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-turing-dispersion-pearson-r-analytical-vs-pde-stepper>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-cloudina-hartmannae-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-turing-dispersion-rmse>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-cloudina-hartmannae-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-cloudina-hartmannae-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-cloudina-hartmannae-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation-3>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-cloudina-hartmannae-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation-4> ;
