<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/morphoeval-delphi10000-cloudina-hartmannae-turing-wavelength-s0> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Cloudina hartmannae wall-normal Turing lamella at 2.397 µm (Pass 2) (Cloudina hartmannae)",
        "Cloudina hartmannae wall-normal Turing lamella at 2.397 µm (Pass 2) faithfully reproduces Cloudina hartmannae morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/delphi10000-cloudina-hartmannae-turing-wavelength-s0-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/delphi10000-cloudina-hartmannae-turing-wavelength-s0-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/delphi10000-cloudina-hartmannae-turing-wavelength-s0-3>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/delphi10000-cloudina-hartmannae-turing-wavelength-s0-4>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/delphi10000-cloudina-hartmannae-turing-wavelength-s0-5> ;
    dct:description "The simulation script(s) models/2026-delphi10000-cloudina-hartmannae-turing-wavelength-s0.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Cloudina hartmannae specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is carried by the MorphoEval rubric assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/main/models/2026-delphi10000-cloudina-hartmannae-turing-wavelength-s0.py> ;
    schema:about "Cloudina hartmannae" ;
    schema:additionalProperty "does_not_claim: That Cloudina had ocelli or a measured pigment stripe at 2.397 µm",
        "does_not_claim: That slot 1252 parameters were copied",
        "does_not_claim: That the Wikimedia life restoration is a fossil photograph",
        "does_not_claim: That the species card or the Corumbá slab is a Nama Group lamella SEM",
        "reconstructed_in_script: Jacobian and diffusivities with lambda_c fixed at 2.397 µm and a small positive discriminant",
        "reconstructed_in_script: Noise-seeded nonlinear stack, equal-diffusion control, autocatalysis ablation, diffusivity sweep",
        "reconstructed_in_script: Segmentation of the species card and the CC BY 2.0 Corumbá photograph",
        "reported_in_source: Grant 1990: shell layers 8–50 µm",
        "reported_in_source: Penny et al. 2014: Omkyk ash 547.32 ± 0.31 Ma; slot age remains 549 Ma",
        "reported_in_source: Turing 1952 critical wavenumber and Schnakenberg 1979 kinetics",
        "reported_in_source: Yang et al. 2020: Namibian Cloudina organic lamellae 0.5–5 µm, up to eight per wall layer",
        "transfer_boundary: Applying a reaction-diffusion lamella wavelength to Cloudina is a morphospace hypothesis",
        "transfer_boundary: Grant's cnidarian-grade reading and Yang's annelid-grade reading are both left open" ;
    pk:anatomicalStructure "Turing pigment stripe / ocellus wavelength in Cloudina hartmannae (Terminal Ediacaran (Nama Group, 549 Ma))" ;
